ent-NCImplantMuscleBoneLace = Grafted Muscle and Bone Lace implant
    .desc = A whole-body muscle graft and bone reinforcement kit. Reinforces existing bones rather than replacing them. Passive; needs no battery or neural link. Reduces hardsuit slowdown.
ent-NCImplantLinearFrameSigma = implanted linear frame Sigma
    .desc = An internal powered load-bearing frame. Requires operational muscle and bone augmentation, power and calibration. Exact requirements and slowdown compensation are shown by a body scanner.
ent-NCImplantLinearFrameBeta = implanted linear frame Beta
    .desc = A heavy implanted load-bearing frame. Requires extensive muscle and bone augmentation, power and calibration. Exact requirements and slowdown compensation are shown by a body scanner.

